GUIDE       (do not edit this file unless you know what you are doing)
  46.2      (version of GUIDE)
 2          (1=model fitting, 2=importance or DIF scoring, 3=data conversion)
"imp.out"   (name of batch output file)
 1          (1=classification, 2=regression, 3=propensity score tree)
 1          (1=default options, 2=otherwise)
"rhcdsc1.txt" (name of DSC file)
 1          (1=estimated priors, 2=equal priors, 3=other priors)
 1          (1=unit misclassification costs, 2=other)
 0          (0=no LaTeX tree, 1=tree without node numbers, 2=with node numbers)
 1          (1=skip storing split/fit variables, 2=store variables, 3=store values)
 1          (1=skip creating new DSC file, 2=create file)
 1          (1=output importance scores to a file, 2=otherwise)
"imp.scr"   (file name for importance scores)

